				<guid isPermaLink="false">https://bkcs.hust.edu.vn/?post_type=courses&#038;p=225</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[This course provides essential skills and techniques that the learners need to secure their critical information and defend their networks.]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="has-text-align-justify has-text-align-justify">This course provides essential skills and techniques that the learners need to secure their critical information and defend their networks.</p>



<p><strong>Topic 1: Introduction to cyber security</strong></p>



<p>The evolution of cyber security</p>



<p>Security standards, regulations, and frameworks</p>



<p>Cyber Threats, vulnerabilities, and risks</p>



<p>Trending topics in cyber security</p>



<p><strong>Topic 2: Malware</strong></p>



<p>What is malware?</p>



<p>Types of malwares</p>



<p>Malware attack life cycle</p>



<p>Malware detection and response</p>



<p><strong>Topic 3: Data encryption and integrity</strong></p>



<p>Cryptography: the Basics</p>



<p>Data encryption</p>



<p>Hashing</p>



<p>Digital signature</p>



<p><strong>Topic 4: Digital identity protection</strong></p>



<p>Phishing for usernames and passwords&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>



<p>Password management techniques</p>



<p>Authentication, Authorization, and Accounting</p>



<p><strong>Topic 5: Fundamentals of network security</strong></p>



<p>Secure network protocols</p>



<p>Network attacks</p>



<p>Introduction to firewalls and intrusion detection systems</p>



<p>Networking security best practices</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
